	(descr "Cinch 142-0701-201 SMA 50 Ohm Straight Jack Receptacle, vertical through-hole PCB mount, gold plated. Mounting hole layout per datasheet: one 1.57 mm center pin hole + four 1.70 mm ground tab holes on a 5.08 mm (0.200 in) square pattern (corners at +/-2.54, +/-2.54). Connector body extends up from the board (+Z), 9.52 mm square base with 7.92 mm hex nut above. All four ground tabs are electrically pad 2 (shield). Pad 1 = center pin = signal. 142-0701-206 is the nickel-plated equivalent with the same footprint. Datasheet: Documentation/Components/pi-ccs-john-142-0701-201.pdf.")
